From: Package maintainers <packages@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] search layered system configuration before vendor defaults
Source: https://github.com/Alexays/Waybar/archive/refs/tags/0.15.0.tar.gz
Upstream: Not submitted; this is a generic UAPI configuration proposal.

Install the required default configuration and stylesheet below /usr/share.
Search the standard XDG user and administrator directories first, followed by
/run/xdg and the packaged files. Keep Waybar's legacy $HOME/waybar lookup and
source-tree fallback for compatibility.

Add a standalone test for the complete directory order and for file selection
across the writable layers.
